","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-032-qi","source_id":"s-shiji-032-qi","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-032-qi:p051","quote":"十九年五月，昭公卒，子舍立為齊君。"}],"attestations":[{"id":"th-shiji032-016:a001","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-032-qi:p051","start":14,"end":16,"surface":"齊君","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m051-0011","usage":"narrative"}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"source_event","event_type":"grant","date_expression":"十九年五月","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-032-qi","source_id":"s-shiji-032-qi","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-032-qi:p051","quote":"十九年五月，昭公卒，子舍立為齊君。"}]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"授予、自立、追稱及用稱分開；官位、爵等及制度未核處保持未分類。日期原表述不換算，死亡與後稱不自動結束官爵。工正明示受任，拒絕卿不另作持有。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"address_assertions":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-shiji032-069","person_id":"cbr-p001141","surfaces":["舍","齊君舍"],"scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-032-qi"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-032-qi:p051","quote":"十九年五月，昭公卒，子舍立為齊君。捨之母無寵於昭公，國人莫畏。昭公之弟商人以桓公死爭立而不得，陰交賢士，附愛百姓，百姓說。及昭公卒，子舍立，孤弱，即與眾十月即墓上弒齊君舍，而商人自立，是為懿公。懿公，桓公子也，其母曰密姬。"}],"rationale":"按本篇小白立桓公、管仲任政、葵丘盟會及齊君／母親的明示敘事相接暫定；魯與齊的同號君主、同氏女性分開，不作全庫字串合併。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:p051","text":"十九年五月，昭公卒，子舍立為齊君。捨之母無寵於昭公，國人莫畏。昭公之弟商人以桓公死爭立而不得，陰交賢士，附愛百姓，百姓說。及昭公卒，子舍立，孤弱，即與眾十月即墓上弒齊君舍，而商人自立，是為懿公。懿公，桓公子也，其母曰密姬。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m051-0006","start":6,"end":8,"surface":"昭公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001135","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m051-0011","start":11,"end":12,"surface":"舍","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001141","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m051-0017","start":17,"end":20,"surface":"捨之母","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、